TITLE:: RCCrawler
summary:: An agent owning attributes of one orgnsm at a time, jumping between orgnsms
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCCrawlerMoves, Classes/RCOrgnsm, Classes/RCBatch

DESCRIPTION::
Port of the proto-library's crawler. Its (silent) pattern orgnsm runs code::make_jump:: (jump to link::#-nextOrgnsm::), then code::next_val::, then code::set_next_val:: (apply the value) at every event. Keys with strong::keyIsMethod:: are applied by calling code::orgnsm.<camelCase key>(value)::.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: new
argument:: attrKeys
argument:: keyIsMethod

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: init
argument:: orgnsm
argument:: val
METHOD:: initFromBatch
argument:: batch
argument:: batchKey
argument:: idxStart
argument:: val
METHOD:: nextOrgnsm
The orgnsm to jump to at the next code::make_jump::, or a function of the crawler returning it, evaluated at each jump (e.g. code::{ |c| c.orgnsm.tribeDict.values.choose }::). A failing function is reported and the crawler stays where it is.
METHOD:: leaveVal
Value applied to the orgnsm being left when link::#-setLeaveVal:: is true, or a function of the crawler returning it (e.g. code::{ |c| c.prevVal }:: restores what the orgnsm had before the crawler arrived).
METHOD:: setLeaveVal
METHOD:: patternAttrs
Event with code::tribe::, code::static_attrs::, code::attr_dict_base::, code::add_first_array_base:: of the pattern orgnsm.
